creasingly dangerous kitchens in an effort to stop the Unbread menace and save their world from being overrun.", "summary": "Overcooked 2 is a cooperative cooking simulation game for up to four players. Teams work together to prepare and serve food orders in increasingly chaotic kitchen environments, coordinating tasks like chopping, cooking, plating, and dishwashing under time pressure. Levels feature dynamic obstacles such as moving floors, portals, fires, and shifting layouts that complicate coordination. The sequel to Overcooked introduces a throwing mechanic for tossing ingredients across the kitchen and adds online multiplayer alongside local co-op.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/overcooked-2", "videos": [{"id": 21516, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "uKLb8D36YKk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uKLb8D36YKk", "title": "Overcooked 2 \u2013 Launch Trailer | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uKLb8D36YKk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 20651, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ZKNO0MsDV2k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZKNO0MsDV2k", "title": "Overcooked 2 - Announcement Trailer - Nintendo E3 2018", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZKNO0MsDV2k/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 161842, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "ci9jNv_L3VE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ci9jNv_L3VE", "title": "Overcooked! 2 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition \u2013 Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ci9jNv_L3VE/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5443, "name": "Overcooked"}]}